): auto-detected LTHR 168, zones\n./readback/watch-notes.md:7:it (see `event-184233-as-sent.json`); `workout_doc.steps` is populated, so the\n./readback/watch-notes.md:17:Every corridor shows up as one of the watch's own zone bands, not the range we\n./readback/watch-notes.md:19:zone edges, never 151–160 or 129–141. Earlier tries: `units: \"bpm\"` with\n./readback/watch-notes.md:21:every target a constant 101.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
