{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"agent_message","text":"Intervals.icu’s published workout schema uses `start` and `end` for ranges. The current generator emits `value` and `end`, which does not describe the intended lower and upper bounds. Forum API examples also show that a `workout_doc` alone can read back correctly while a device export loses steps, so I’m adding a matching workout description for the export path."}}
